CAL","id":2070301,"initDialog":207030101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[2070302,2070303],"npcId":[1555],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":20703,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":207030101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":627914770,"text":"What a shame, I can't use this material either...","nextNodeIds":[207030102]},{"nodeId":207030102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3780799250,"text":"What are you working on?","nextNodeIds":[207030103]},{"nodeId":207030103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":4076512354,"text":"I mean to write a new book about Mondstadt's history that focuses on Anemo, and I'm looking for inspiration here.","nextNodeIds":[207030104]},{"nodeId":207030104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":2040030418,"text":"If you think about it, this place is the ideal spot — there's a Statue of The Seven that represents Anemo, and a tree that's closely linked to the legend of the great hero Vennessa.","nextNodeIds":[207030105]},{"nodeId":207030105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":2843274554,"text":"Yet — and I know this might sound funny — looking for and gathering Anemo without a Vision, which I lack, is too difficult.","nextNodeIds":[207030106]},{"nodeId":207030106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":2911465506,"text":"And this so-called search for inspiration? Why, I'm just staring into space here. Most of my material is synthesized from second-hand resources as well.","nextNodeIds":[207030107]},{"nodeId":207030107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":3992856434,"text":"That's the life of a person without a Vision on this continent — to do much, and yet achieve little.","nextNodeIds":[207030108]},{"nodeId":207030108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":3444838818,"text":"One cannot use the power of the elements without a Vision. Whether in research or in life, those without them live like outsiders in their own world.","nextNodeIds":[207030109]},{"nodeId":207030109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":2122963186,"text":"Hahaha, maybe in the eyes of the gods, Vision wielders are the main characters of this world.","nextNodeIds":[207030110]},{"nodeId":207030110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":2575990850,"text":"Sorry, I said too much, and while I did say all this, I won't give up on my research.","nextNodeIds":[207030111]},{"nodeId":207030111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":3049457578,"text":"I don't have a Vision, but I won't lose in terms of scholarship.","nextNodeIds":[207030112]},{"nodeId":207030112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":1459566858,"text":"I've also heard that you can use the elements even without a Vision...","nextNodeIds":[207030113]},{"nodeId":207030113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":2154202234,"text":"If you could help me to grab some objects imbued with Anemo, that would really help me with my research.","nextNodeIds":[207030114]},{"nodeId":207030114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1555,"speakerName":"Dr. Edith","textMapHash":251950786,"text":"Could you help me climb up this tree and have a look?","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":2070302,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","